==Battleground==
*4 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*6 [[MikuDoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Hatsune Miku (Enemy)|Hatsune Miku]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[MikuDoge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**20 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

